OL,3,CMan jailed for 17 years following
OL,4,Cmurder of his father
OL,6,FA Cumbrian man has been jailed for 17
OL,7,Fyears for the murder of his father.
OL,9,FBrian Smith, 33, of Friars Garth,
OL,10,FWigton, was found guilty of the murder
OL,11,Fof his father, Stanley Smith, 73,
OL,12,Ffollowing a trial in July.
OL,14,FToday, 7 August, at Carlisle Crown
OL,15,FCourt, Smith was sentenced to 17 years
OL,16,Fand 139 days in prison before being
OL,17,Feligible for parole.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/7
