OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786128505
OL,3,CMan jailed for 17 years following
OL,4,Cmurder of his father
OL,6,FThe court heard how on 22 December
OL,7,F2025, police received a called from
OL,8,FNorth West Ambulance Service in the
OL,9,Fearly hours of the morning requiring
OL,10,Fassistance for a 73-year-old man who
OL,11,Fwas unresponsive and not breathing.
OL,13,FSmith explained his father's condition
OL,14,Fas the result of a fall, telling
OL,15,Fofficers he had left him asleep on the
OL,16,Ffloor.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786128505
OL,3,CMan jailed for 17 years following
OL,4,Cmurder of his father
OL,6,FBut following a police investigation
OL,7,Fand detailed forensic and medical
OL,8,Fevidence, it was established that
OL,9,FStanley Smith had been subjected to
OL,10,Fsignificant pressure to his neck,
OL,11,Fcausing fatal injuries.
OL,13,FCCTV footage showed Smith and his
OL,14,Ffather walking arm in arm through the
OL,15,Fstreets after spending the evening at
OL,16,Fa local pub.
OL,18,FJust hours later Smith attacked his
OL,19,Ffather following an argument.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786128505
OL,3,CMan jailed for 17 years following
OL,4,Cmurder of his father
OL,6,FWhen sentencing Smith, Judge Nicholas
OL,7,FBarker said: "Within minutes of
OL,8,Fchoking your own father to death you
OL,9,Fbegan to lay a false narrative of what
OL,10,Fhappened.
OL,12,F"Either Stanley was alive and you did
OL,13,Fnot seek any assistance for him. Or
OL,14,Fknowing he was dead you began to lay a
OL,15,Ffalse narrative, blaming the violence
OL,16,Fon him."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786128505
OL,3,CMan jailed for 17 years following
OL,4,Cmurder of his father
OL,6,FSteven Byrne, Senior Investigating
OL,7,FOfficer, said: "Smith's account of
OL,8,Fwhat happened to his father did not
OL,9,Fwithstand scrutiny. While he claimed
OL,10,FStanley had simply fallen and was
OL,11,Fasleep on the floor, the evidence told
OL,12,Fa very different story.
OL,14,F"Our investigation established that
OL,15,FStanley died as a result of fatal
OL,16,Fpressure being applied to his neck.
OL,17,FThrough careful forensic examination
OL,18,Fand detailed investigative work, we
OL,19,Fwere able to build a compelling case
OL,20,Fwhich has now resulted in Smith being
OL,21,Fconvicted of murder.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786128505
OL,3,CMan jailed for 17 years following
OL,4,Cmurder of his father
OL,6,F"This conviction reflects the hard
OL,7,Fwork and determination of everyone
OL,8,Finvolved in the investigation and
OL,9,Fensures Smith is held accountable for
OL,10,Fhis actions."
OL,12,FOnce released Smith will be on licence
OL,13,Ffor the remainder of his life and will
OL,14,Fbe returned to prison at any point
OL,15,Fshould he commit further offences.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/7
